@ [canonical_uuid] d439964f-e7a1-4557-acd0-14930620dbe0

& [Observation]
  + the first exact-current Windows workspace debug command omitted the repository-established RUST_MIN_STACK precondition
  + succeeding_sop_fixture_persistence and succeeding_sop_fixture_rollback each ended in STATUS_STACK_OVERFLOW at commission_forms_refuse_unknown_fields_and_oversize
  + all completed assertions before and after those targets passed and the capacity suite itself passed five tests

& [Diagnosis]
  + the same failing targets pass unchanged with an enlarged test-thread stack
  + prior governed Windows workspace proofs select RUST_MIN_STACK 33554432 and one test thread for these deeply nested typed fixtures
  + this is a harness-capacity failure rather than a semantic regression

& [Correction]
  + final exact commands use CARGO_BUILD_JOBS 1 CARGO_INCREMENTAL 0 RUST_TEST_THREADS 1 RUST_MIN_STACK 33554432 locked offline all-target all-feature dependencies and D-drive targets
  + corrected debug and overflow-checked release each pass 267 groups 1632 tests zero failed thirteen ignored

& [Prevention]
  + future native Windows full-workspace gates must load the governed stack and serialization preconditions in the same command that launches Cargo
